# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Data
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Extract files are large and are not ours to publish: they live outside the
# repository and must stay there. Anything a reader needs to run the pipeline
# is produced on demand by `da-pipeline-demo`.
*.h5
*.hdf5
data/
demo_data/

# Pipeline results, in case anyone points a run at the repository.
Data_Analytics/
Data_Analytics_*/

# One-off scripts that migrate a local dataset into the layout below. They
# necessarily pair the current names with whatever the files used before, so
# committing one would publish exactly the mapping this layout exists to avoid.
rebuild_h5.py
migrate_*.py

# Windows
desktop.ini
Thumbs.db
